  Description: Prerequisites Kobold ancestry You are a digger from the Hookclaw kobold
    tribe, born beneath the streets of Absalom, with muscles and mind hardened by
    years spent tunneling through rock and earth and a confidence built upon your
    pride in your draconic heritage. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to
    Strength or Charisma , and one is a free attribute boost. You're trained in the
    Crafting skill, the Mining Lore skill, and the Engineering Lore skill. You gain
    the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Improvise Tool] skill feat.
